 temper, know-it-all). So maintain vote for B.\n\nThus public message: agree with Agent 3, reaffirm B, note that while decision-quality evidence missing, other strengths outweigh, and we should still recommend B, but we need to monitor crew cooperation and adaptability.\n\nNow produce JSON: {\"agent\":\"agent_2\",\"vote\":\"Candidate B\"}.\n\nProceed."}
